## How to run

```bash
source scripts/load-secrets.sh    # if API keys needed
quarkus dev                       # live coding mode
```

## How to test

```bash
mvn test                          # unit tests
mvn verify                        # unit + integration tests
newman run test-data/postman/*.postman_collection.json  # API tests
```

## Key file locations

```
src/main/java/                    ← application code
src/main/resources/
  application.properties          ← configuration
src/main/docker/
  Containerfile                   ← UBI 10 multi-stage build
src/test/java/                    ← tests (*Test.java = unit, *IT.java = integration)
logs/                             ← file logging output (gitignored)
test-data/postman/                ← Postman collections
```

## Logging

File logging writes to `logs/{{PROJECT_NAME}}.log` with rotation.
Read with `quarkus_app_log` MCP tool or `Read logs/{{PROJECT_NAME}}.log`.

## MCP tools available

- `quarkus_start` / `quarkus_stop` — lifecycle management
- `quarkus_logs` — read recent log output
- `quarkus_skills` — get extension-specific coding patterns
- `quarkus_searchDocs` — search Quarkus documentation
